WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.098
Count nouns can be counted, while non-count nouns usually take measures; collective

00:00:05.098 --> 00:00:06.323
nouns name groups.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:12.001
Which word usually names something we cannot count as separate items without a

00:00:12.001 --> 00:00:13.109
measure? Answer: water

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:18.515
Sort rice, chairs, team and water, then write appropriate quantity expressions.

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:21.692
Water is commonly a non-count noun.
